  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;

&lt;p&gt;附上上次战绩（感觉还好）：&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/a/8/c/a8c25c1d0b2808557f762674745ace49cbd5a211.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/o4UCZYmv6dqy163pgsp6g7faPzb.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;580e3e13-2303-48f6-9b72-d939c7141ea5&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/a/8/c/a8c25c1d0b2808557f762674745ace49cbd5a211.png&quot; alt=&quot;580e3e13-2303-48f6-9b72-d939c7141ea5&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;o4UCZYmv6dqy163pgsp6g7faPzb&quot; width=&quot;241&quot; height=&quot;135&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
